{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}热榜 · {{ site.name }}{% endblock %}
{% block description %}近 1 个月 / 3 个月 / 1 年被引最多的化学研究论文{% endblock %}
{% block main %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1>热榜</h1>
  <p>这段时间被同行引用最多的化学研究论文，每月初更新。只算原创研究，不算综述；范围是本站收录的 {{ n_sources }} 个来源里的期刊。</p>
  <p class="muted-note">更新于 {{ hot.updated }} · 被引数来自 OpenAlex，新论文的被引普遍偏小，看个相对热度</p>
</section>

<div class="tabs">
  {% for w in hot.windows %}
  <input type="radio" name="win" id="win-{{ w.key }}" {% if loop.index == 2 %}checked{% endif %}>
  {% endfor %}
  <div class="tab-labels">
    {% for w in hot.windows %}<label for="win-{{ w.key }}">{{ w.label }}</label>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% for w in hot.windows %}
  <ol class="hotlist panel-{{ w.key }}">
    {% for it in w["items"] %}
    <li>
      <span class="rank">{{ loop.index }}</span>
      <div class="hot-body">
        <h2><a href="{{ it.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ it.title_zh }}</a></h2>
        {% if it.one_line %}<p class="blurb">{{ it.one_line }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p class="en">{{ it.title_en }}</p>
        <p class="hot-meta"><span class="src">{{ it.source }}</span><span>被引 <b>{{ it.cited }}</b></span><span>{{ it.date }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endblock %}
